etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信支付发布AI专属卡，支持Agent闭环消费并实现主账户完全隔离</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX以600亿美元全股票方式收购AI编程初创公司Cursor</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正筹备发布新一代双向语音模型GPT-Bidi-1以升级ChatGPT语音模式</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱AI正式开源旗舰模型GLM-5.2，支持1M无损上下文处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4989f6959a08a983425b2e278b206c8d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱AI今日宣布正式上线并开源新一代旗舰模型GLM-5.2，该模型采用MIT开源协议，允许开发者与企业自由商用。GLM-5.2核心优势在于长程任务处理能力，具备高达1M的无损上下文窗口，在压力测试中可一次性处理近88万字内容，并独立完成跨平台应用开发交付。在代码能力方面，该模型在全球前端开发盲测评估中位列全球可用模型第一，在多项国际权威评测中表现已逼近顶尖闭源模型。为推动技术普惠，GLM-5.2发布首日即完成对华为昇腾、平头哥、摩尔线程及寒武纪等国产算力平台的深度适配，确保线上推理平稳运行。目前，模型完整权重已上线主流开源社区，智谱开放平台同步提供API接口，支持企业快速接入并构建长文本应用，此举将显著降低长文本大模型落地门槛，加速国内AI生态繁荣。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软正式发布企业级智能体Copilot Cowork，单次提示成本降低近四成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3b1e23b790286adb65308a588b67ba9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软正式在全球范围内上线企业级智能体产品Copilot Cowork，旨在通过端到端自动化处理复杂且长周期的多工具任务。该智能体支持云托管执行，即便用户关闭终端，任务仍可后台持续运行，并原生集成上下文引擎。在性价比方面，官方数据显示Copilot Cowork单次提示成本较Claude Cowork降低30%至40%。产品在正式发布前已完成三个月预览测试，获埃森哲、苏黎世保险等超半数财富500强企业采用。Copilot Cowork继承Microsoft 365企业级安全标准，支持多模型选择，并采用基于模型使用、上下文检索、工具调用及运行时间的按用量积分计费模式，为企业提供灵活的成本控制方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信支付发布AI专属卡，支持Agent闭环消费并实现主账户完全隔离</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e74f3ca8cfc1b28904026b867e952ad3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月17日，微信支付正式发布专为AI Agent打造的“AI专属卡”，旨在解决智能体落地消费场景的资金流难题。该产品已率先在Mac端5.1.1版本的WorkBuddy平台上线，用户可通过“美团生活助手”实现从智能推荐、下单到支付的全链路闭环。针对安全风险，微信支付采用“主账隔离”架构，AI专属卡独立于主账户，Agent仅能调取卡内有限余额。此外，每笔订单在执行前均需用户本人授权确认，且卡内额度支持随时转入与转出。此举通过“办事钱包”模式，赋予Agent离线资金调配能力，标志着AI生态从单纯的信息获取向服务消费商业化闭环迈进。未来，该功能将向更多Agent平台开放，加速大模型向行动智能演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX以600亿美元全股票方式收购AI编程初创公司Cursor</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8495333cc73fd708a9f4b2acf78a186.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX正式宣布以600亿美元全股票交易收购AI编程初创公司Cursor，其母公司Anysphere将于今年第三季度成为SpaceX全资子公司。该交易基于双方今年4月达成的收购选择权协议，Cursor股东将获得SpaceX股票作为补偿。此次收购旨在强化SpaceX在AI辅助编程领域的布局，通过整合Cursor的AI编码技术及开发者社群，缩小与OpenAI、Anthropic等行业领先者的差距。SpaceX近期市值突破2万亿美元，此前已完成与xAI的合并。通过将火箭发射、卫星互联网与AI业务整合，SpaceX正加速构建企业级AI应用生态，将AI基础设施视为长期增长的核心引擎。Cursor作为AI编程领域的头部工具，其加入将直接提升SpaceX在软件工程自动化及企业级AI解决方案方面的技术竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正筹备发布新一代双向语音模型GPT-Bidi-1以升级ChatGPT语音模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f894fe16cd0923bc1313bdc0e6ad59f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正筹备推出下一代双向音频模型“GPT-Bidi-1”，旨在对ChatGPT语音模式进行重大技术升级。该模型采用双向（Bidirectional）架构，支持系统同时进行聆听与表达，可实时捕捉用户插话并动态调整语义输出，彻底改变了以往“单工对讲”的交互局限。目前，OpenAI已在Web端和移动端完成基础代码铺设。产品形态上，该模型将与现有的Advanced Voice Mode并存，用户可自主切换至“Bidi(最新)”模式。此外，GPT-Bidi-1首度在语音端引入“高、中、即时”三种智力与速度分级，允许用户在交互深度与响应速度间进行权衡。此次迭代不仅补齐了OpenAI在语音与文本大模型（GPT-5.5）之间的推理能力断层，更标志着其向“Audio-first”战略迈进，为后续语音优先的硬件设备及企业级</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
